Package: claude-wg-client
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: wireguard-tools, nftables, iproute2, procps, systemd
Maintainer: Claude client owner
Description: Fail-closed WireGuard client policy for Debian 12 WSL2
 Installs a scoped early egress guard and a key-loading drop-in around the
 distribution-provided wg-quick service. Installation never starts a service,
 writes a key, replaces a resolver, or changes a live network route.
